      "start_ms": 19500,
      "end_ms": 24000,
      "text": "Medium close-up of Alexander's mother arriving beside the frosted wooden door frame under sharp hanging icicles, shivering violently from the freezing cold.",
      "line_number": 61,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP035_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP035",
      "file_index": 11,
